00:26:23.330 --> 00:26:24.390
Can you spare

578
00:26:24.830 --> 00:26:26.070
20 minutes for me,

579
00:26:27.350 --> 00:26:28.470
and I'll treat you to a beer?

580
00:26:28.870 --> 00:26:29.310
Okay.

581
00:26:29.690 --> 00:26:30.650
My friends

582
00:26:30.650 --> 00:26:31.250
made something.

583
00:26:31.650 --> 00:26:32.510
Can you try it?

584
00:26:32.590 --> 00:26:32.910
Sure.

585
00:26:33.190 --> 00:26:34.190
And we sit down.

586
00:26:34.250 --> 00:26:35.210
And so we sat for days

587
00:26:35.210 --> 00:26:36.130
with people

588
00:26:36.130 --> 00:26:36.970
on Obilićev venac,

589
00:26:36.970 --> 00:26:37.970
on Studentski trg.

590
00:26:38.750 --> 00:26:39.730
And people played.

591
00:26:39.890 --> 00:26:40.430
And here we —

592
00:26:40.430 --> 00:26:41.370
again, when it comes

593
00:26:41.370 --> 00:26:42.050
to testing,

594
00:26:42.890 --> 00:26:43.470
the most important thing is

595
00:26:43.470 --> 00:26:44.110
to think

596
00:26:44.110 --> 00:26:46.190
about this behavior.

597
00:26:46.190 --> 00:26:47.030
They may like it

598
00:26:47.030 --> 00:26:47.710
or not like it,

599
00:26:47.710 --> 00:26:48.750
but a great idea is

600
00:26:48.750 --> 00:26:49.750
to see

601
00:26:49.750 --> 00:26:50.490
whether they know how

602
00:26:50.490 --> 00:26:51.410
to use

603
00:26:51.410 --> 00:26:52.390
what you gave them,

604
00:26:52.390 --> 00:26:53.150
and, basically,

605
00:26:53.150 --> 00:26:54.030
at the end ask them:

606
00:26:54.870 --> 00:26:56.250
is this something you'd play?

607
00:26:56.630 --> 00:26:57.250
Why yes?

608
00:26:57.330 --> 00:26:57.690
Why not?

609
00:26:59.010 --> 00:26:59.810
We have another

610
00:26:59.810 --> 00:27:00.670
three and a half minutes.

611
00:27:04.130 --> 00:27:05.050
Design sprint

612
00:27:05.050 --> 00:27:06.790
you can probably google,

613
00:27:06.790 --> 00:27:07.750
but, basically,

614
00:27:07.750 --> 00:27:09.310
it's an idea

615
00:27:09.310 --> 00:27:10.330
that advises you

616
00:27:10.330 --> 00:27:11.170
how to do all that

617
00:27:11.170 --> 00:27:11.710
I was talking about

618
00:27:11.710 --> 00:27:12.590
in a week.

619
00:27:14.370 --> 00:27:14.970
It's doable.

620
00:27:17.600 --> 00:27:18.640
And in the end, yes.

621
00:27:22.440 --> 00:27:24.440
If you want to do something,

622
00:27:24.440 --> 00:27:25.540
spend time

623
00:27:25.540 --> 00:27:25.960
with the people

624
00:27:25.960 --> 00:27:26.840
you're doing it for.

625
00:27:30.380 --> 00:27:31.400
Understand the problem

626
00:27:31.400 --> 00:27:32.340
you're solving

627
00:27:32.340 --> 00:27:32.820
by, again,

628
00:27:32.820 --> 00:27:34.100
sitting a bit longer

629
00:27:34.100 --> 00:27:34.360
with them,

630
00:27:34.360 --> 00:27:35.000
ask them

631
00:27:35.000 --> 00:27:35.960
an additional clarifying question.

632
00:27:35.960 --> 00:27:37.100
Boldly go

633
00:27:37.100 --> 00:27:37.800
wide

634
00:27:37.800 --> 00:27:38.780
with ideas

635
00:27:38.780 --> 00:27:40.320
for solving this problem.

636
00:27:41.120 --> 00:27:42.180
Try to make

637
00:27:42.180 --> 00:27:42.840
a rudimentary version,

638
00:27:45.740 --> 00:27:46.620
so that they can,

639
00:27:46.620 --> 00:27:47.800
so that people can actually

640
00:27:47.800 --> 00:27:48.480
try it,

641
00:27:48.480 --> 00:27:48.980
that is,

642
00:27:48.980 --> 00:27:49.600
experience it,

643
00:27:49.600 --> 00:27:50.520
that's the key word,

644
00:27:50.520 --> 00:27:51.260
and at the end

645
00:27:51.260 --> 00:27:52.200
give it to people,

646
00:27:52.200 --> 00:27:53.060
so they can

647
00:27:53.060 --> 00:27:54.260
see how they like all this.

648
00:27:56.300 --> 00:27:56.980
That's it.

649
00:28:00.220 --> 00:28:01.180
At the end there was

650
00:28:01.180 --> 00:28:01.740
one question:

651
00:28:01.740 --> 00:28:02.780
how do we prototype

652
00:28:02.780 --> 00:28:03.600
games at Nordeus.

653
00:28:04.380 --> 00:28:05.180
Games are

654
00:28:05.180 --> 00:28:06.500
a rather special case,

655
00:28:06.500 --> 00:28:08.360
for the reason that here,

656
00:28:08.820 --> 00:28:09.580
for it to

657
00:28:10.180 --> 00:28:11.300
feel like a game,

658
00:28:11.300 --> 00:28:12.560
it has to be

659
00:28:12.560 --> 00:28:13.100
developed.

660
00:28:13.600 --> 00:28:14.400
So it

661
00:28:14.400 --> 00:28:15.020
gets developed,

662
00:28:15.020 --> 00:28:16.100
but we try to keep it

663
00:28:16.100 --> 00:28:16.540
very short,

664
00:28:16.540 --> 00:28:17.540
let it be two or three weeks.

665
00:28:17.900 --> 00:28:18.420
On the other hand,

666
00:28:18.420 --> 00:28:19.240
if you're testing

667
00:28:19.240 --> 00:28:19.840
features,

668
00:28:19.840 --> 00:28:20.960
that is, things

669
00:28:20.960 --> 00:28:22.300
that are kind of static —

670
00:28:24.040 --> 00:28:24.480
menus,

671
00:28:25.420 --> 00:28:25.860
icons

672
00:28:25.860 --> 00:28:26.660
and so on —

673
00:28:26.660 --> 00:28:27.740
that can easily be done

674
00:28:27.740 --> 00:28:28.420
in XD,

675
00:28:29.160 --> 00:28:30.220
and then it's good

676
00:28:30.220 --> 00:28:30.940
if it's actually

677
00:28:30.940 --> 00:28:31.760
linked, again,

678
00:28:31.760 --> 00:28:32.720
to some other screens,

679
00:28:32.720 --> 00:28:33.680
and we call people:

680
00:28:34.740 --> 00:28:35.560
Hi, hi,

681
00:28:36.660 --> 00:28:38.280
here's this for you, play.

682
00:28:39.400 --> 00:28:40.020
What is this?

683
00:28:40.020 --> 00:28:40.600
Well, like, no idea

684
00:28:40.600 --> 00:28:40.820
what this is,

685
00:28:40.820 --> 00:28:41.280
try playing

686
00:28:41.280 --> 00:28:42.180
and tell me yourself what it is.

687
00:28:42.180 --> 00:28:43.100
And here again you

688
00:28:43.100 --> 00:28:44.380
gather a bunch of information

689
00:28:44.380 --> 00:28:45.400
from their point of view:

690
00:28:45.400 --> 00:28:46.800
what is what you're making,

691
00:28:46.800 --> 00:28:48.040
and how they feel about it.

692
00:28:49.970 --> 00:28:50.930
Great, we've finished

693
00:28:50.930 --> 00:28:52.450
in less than 30 minutes,

694
00:28:52.450 --> 00:28:52.930
so

695
00:28:52.930 --> 00:28:53.670
feel free to

696
00:28:53.670 --> 00:28:54.950
ask me

697
00:28:54.950 --> 00:28:55.590
any question.